{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32634","headline":"经无可旧居兼伤贾岛 · 刘沧","name":"经无可旧居兼伤贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘室寒窗我独看，别来人事几凋残。\n昼空萧寺一僧去，雪满巴山孤客寒。\n落叶堕巢禽自出，苍苔封砌竹成竿。\n碧云迢遰长江远，向夕苦吟归思难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}